2382342899970284","text":"Claude Opus 5.5 just became the latest rumored AI launch for today. Here's what you need to know.\n\nA BridgeMind post says Anthropic could ship Opus 5.5 within hours, claiming Fable 5.1-level intelligence at half the price. Anthropic has not announced the model.\n\nThe rumor arrives after complaints that Opus 5 was slow, while Fable 5.1 can exhaust usage quickly for some Claude Max subscribers. Testing will be needed to verify the performance and price claims.\n\nKey numbers:\n- $200, the cited Claude Max plan price\n- $5/$25 per million input/output tokens, Opus 5's official API price\n\nClaude's official lineup still lists Opus 5 and Fable 5.1.","raw_text":{"text":"Claude Opus 5.5 just became the latest rumored AI launch for today. Here's what you need to know.\n\nA BridgeMind post says Anthropic could ship Opus 5.5 within hours, claiming Fable 5.1-level intelligence at half the price. Anthropic has not announced the model.\n\nThe rumor arrives after complaints that Opus 5 was slow, while Fable 5.1 can exhaust usage quickly for some Claude Max subscribers. Testing will be needed to verify the performance and price claims.\n\nKey numbers:\n- $200, the cited Claude Max plan price\n- $5/$25 per million input/output tokens, Opus 5's official API price\n\nClaude's official lineup still lists Opus 5 and Fable 5.1.","display_text_range":[0,645],"facets":[{"type":"media","indices":[281,304],"id":"2102382306669502464","display":"pic.x.com/kUzulsLKh0","original":"https://t.co/kUzulsLKh0","replacement":"https://x.com/AGTPinsights/status/2102382342899970284/photo/1"}]},"author":{"screen_name":"AGTPinsights","url":"https://x.com/AGTPinsights","id":"2013613489798160388","followers":3647,"following":85,"likes":685,"media_count":2558,"statuses":25052,"name":"AGTP","description":"Live at 10am ET every Monday and Thursday, hosted by @MichaelWaitze and @RonfortMartin.","raw_description":{"text":"Live at 10am ET every Monday and Thursday, hosted by @Michael